<title>USA: Strouds Inc Oct same-store sales rose.</title>
<headline>Strouds Inc Oct same-store sales rose.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Strouds Inc said on Thursday same-store sales for the four-week period ended November 2 rose 0.3 percent from the same period a year ago, while total sales rose to $15.2 million from $12.9 million.</p>
<p>Sales for the 35 weeks ended November 2 rose to approximately $131.3 million from approximately $117.8 million for the same period last year. Year-to-date comparable store sales rose by approximately 1.9 percent.</p>
</text>
